                "lookup_hardcoded": "artillery_projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::battle_camera_max_distance_from_army;;;;;the maximum distance the camera can move from the player\'s army:::::bayonet_melee_attack_bonus;;;;;Using bayonets increases the attack stat of a unit:::::bayonet_ring_reload_time_penalty;;;;;Using Ring bayonets increases the time needed to reload the musket/carbine:::::boarding_bonus_time;;;;;time after ships dock for bonus to be applied to attackers:::::boarding_melee_attack_bonus;;;;;attack bonus for attackers during boarding:::::boarding_melee_defense_bonus;;;;;defense bonus for attackers during boarding:::::building_ignition_rain_multiplier;;;;;All projectile contributions to building ignition are multiplied by this amount when raining:::::bulletproof_projectile_damage;;;;;the damage caused by bullet projectiles to units designated as \'bulletproof\'.:::::charge_cool_down_time;;;;;time over which to fade out charge bonus after charge complete:::::climbing_walls_fall_chance_ashigaru;;;;;chance of accidentally falling off wall per second - for ashigaru:::::climbing_walls_fall_chance_samurai;;;;;chance of accidentally falling off wall per second - for samurai:::::climbing_walls_min_width;;;;;minimum width in metres to search for climbing pipes:::::climbing_walls_penalty_time;;;;;time after men reach top of walls to apply penalty:::::fire_rocket_projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::hnbonus_melee_cavalry_v_infantry;;;;;melee bonus for cavalry vs infantry:::::hnbonus_melee_cavalry_v_squareinfantry;;;;;melee bonus for cavalry vs infantry in square formation:::::hnbonus_melee_loose_formation;;;;;melee bonus against defenders in loose formation:::::land_mortar_projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::last_stand_siege_accuracy_penalty;;;;;accuracy penalty applied to a defending unit if it is in fight to the death.:::::last_stand_siege_melee_attacker;;;;;bonus an attacking unit in a siege will get to hit number against a defending unit in fight to the death.:::::last_stand_siege_melee_defender;;;;;penalty a defending unit in a siege will get to hit number if it is in fight to the death.:::::last_stand_siege_reload_penalty;;;;;reload rate penalty applied to a defending unit if it is in fight to the death.:::::magazine_explosion_interrupt_chance;;;;;% chance of ship magazine exploding once a hit registers:::::mangonel_projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::melee_environment_forest_multiplier;;;;;percentage of melee attack applied as a negative modifier when cav are fighting in forest:::::misfire_cannon_flintlock;;;;;Misfire of a cannon with matchlock:::::misfire_cannon_matchlock;;;;;Misfire of a cannon with matchlock:::::misfire_musket_flintlock;;;;;Misfire of a musket with flintlock:::::misfire_musket_matchlock;;;;;Misfire of a musket with matchlock ( 0.2 means a 20% chance of misfire):::::misfire_musket_percussion_cap;;;;;Misfire of a musket with percussion cap:::::missile_distance_for_half_chance_hit;;;;;Projectile system: infantry calibration distance at which marksmanship = chance to hit calibration target:::::missile_distance_for_half_chance_hit_artillery;;;;;Projectile system: artillery calibration distance at which marksmanship = chance to hit calibration target.:::::missile_distance_for_half_chance_hit_naval;;;;;Projectile system: naval gun calibration distance at which marksmanship = chance to hit calibration target.:::::missile_heavy_fog_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;visibility accuracy multiplier for heavy fog weather:::::missile_heavy_rain_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;visibility accuracy multiplier for heavy rain weather:::::missile_heavy_snow_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;visibility accuracy multiplier for heavy snow weather:::::missile_light_fog_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;visibility accuracy multiplier for light fog weather:::::missile_light_rain_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;visibility accuracy multiplier for light rain weather:::::missile_light_snow_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;visibility accuracy multiplier for light snow weather:::::missile_medium_fog_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;visibility accuracy multiplier for medium fog weather:::::missile_medium_rain_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;visibility accuracy multiplier for medium rain weather:::::missile_medium_snow_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;visibility accuracy multiplier for medium snow weather:::::naval_projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::projectile_damage_accuracy_multiplier;;;;;Projectile rule system: multiplier to attacker accuracy (core marksmanship) before adding to kill chance:::::projectile_damage_armour_divisor;;;;;Projectile rule system: divisor for armour stat subtraction from kill chance:::::projectile_damage_base_multiplier;;;;;Projectile rule system: base multiplier to projectile damage (kill chance) before applying other modifiers:::::projectile_damage_defense_divisor;;;;;Projectile rule system: divisor for defence stat subtraction from kill chance:::::projectile_damage_distance_multiplier;;;;;Projectile rule system: multiplier applied to distance/range for subtraction from kill chance:::::projectile_damage_shield_divisor;;;;;Projectile rule system: divisor for shield stat subtraction from kill chance:::::projectile_environment_forest_multiplier;;;;;percentage of marksmanship applied as a negative modifier when targeting a unit in a forest:::::projectile_incendiary_chance_high;;;;;Projectile_rule_system: chance to cause fire on hit (divide by # of fragments):::::projectile_incendiary_chance_low;;;;;Projectile_rule_system: chance to cause fire on hit (divide by # of fragments):::::projectile_incendiary_chance_medium;;;;;Projectile_rule_system: chance to cause fire on hit (divide by # of fragments):::::reload_rate_bow_modifier_rain;;;;;applied to all archer units in rain:::::reload_rate_bow_modifier_snow;;;;;applied to all archer units in snow:::::reload_rate_gun_modifier_rain;;;;;applied to all gunpowder units in rain:::::reload_rate_gun_modifier_snow;;;;;applied to all gunpowder units in snow:::::ship_chance_of_fire_rain_multiplier;;;;;The probability of a projectile causing a fire is multiplied by this amount when raining:::::ship_combustion_rain_multiplier;;;;;The rate of ship combustion is multiplied by this amount when raining:::::ship_on_fire_combustion_modifier;;;;;modifying the rate of combustion:::::ship_ramming_damage_randomiser;;;;;from 0 to 1.0 a random amount up to this ratio will be deducted from the calculated damage.:::::ship_repair_max_percentage;;;;;max repair percentage:::::ship_repair_percentage_per_update;;;;;percentage of repair each update:::::ship_repair_rate;;;;;repairs every x seconds related to the proportion of the marines, seamen and gunners:::::ship_static_target_accuracy_modifier;;;;;accuracy bonus for ships firing at static targets, currently only applied when firing at coastal batteries",
            },
        },
        "_kv_special_ability_effects_tables": {
            "key": {
                "lookup_hardcoded": "special_ability_bonus_active_hide_charge_attack;;;;;Bonus to charge when using active hiding (aka assassinate):::::special_ability_bonus_active_hide_melee_attack;;;;;Bonus to melee attack when using active hiding (aka assassinate):::::special_ability_bonus_active_hide_spot_range;;;;;Spotting ranges against a ninja unit using active hiding are reduced to this percentage whilst the ability is active. e.g. 0.4 means 40% spotting range.:::::special_ability_bonus_artillery_accuracy;;;;;boost is applied to the unit\'s core marksmanship:::::special_ability_bonus_artillery_rof;;;;;boost is applied to the unit\'s core loading skill:::::special_ability_bonus_banzai_charge_attack;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_bonus_banzai_melee_attack;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_bonus_banzai_move_speed;;;;;Speed bonus applied to a unit during Banzai\'s bonus phase. A value of 0.4 would mean a 40% speed bonus.:::::special_ability_bonus_banzai_naval_melee_attack;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_bonus_banzai_naval_melee_defence;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_bonus_battle_speed_naval_move_speed;;;;;Speed bonus applied to a unit during the faster rowing bonus phase. A value of 0.4 would mean a 40% speed bonus.:::::special_ability_bonus_cantabrian_circle_marksmanship;;;;;stat bonus applied to unit\'s marksmanship when in cantabrian circle order:::::special_ability_bonus_cantabrian_circle_reload_rate;;;;;stat boost is applied to the unit\'s core loading skill:::::special_ability_bonus_encourage_fleet_marksmanship;;;;;Bonus to crews\' (all types) marksmanship:::::special_ability_bonus_encourage_fleet_melee_attack;;;;;Bonus to crews\' (all types) melee attack:::::special_ability_bonus_encourage_fleet_melee_defence;;;;;Bonus to crews\' (all types) melee defence:::::special_ability_bonus_encourage_fleet_reload_rate;;;;;Bonus to crews\' (all types) reload rate:::::special_ability_bonus_faster_reload_reload_rate;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_bonus_faster_rowing_move_speed;;;;;Speed bonus applied to a unit during the faster rowing bonus phase. A value of 0.4 would mean a 40% speed bonus.:::::special_ability_bonus_ganbatte_accuracy;;;;;Bonus to everyone\'s accuracy when ganbatte is active:::::special_ability_bonus_ganbatte_melee_attack;;;;;Bonus to everyone\'s melee attack when ganbatte is active:::::special_ability_bonus_ganbatte_morale;;;;;Bonus to everyone\'s morale when ganbatte is active:::::special_ability_bonus_ganbatte_reload;;;;;Bonus to everyone\'s reload when ganbatte is active:::::special_ability_bonus_heroic_assault_fatigue_reduction;;;;;The reductino in total fatigue applied when this ability is activated:::::special_ability_bonus_heroic_assault_morale;;;;;The increase in morale that\'s applied:::::special_ability_bonus_heroic_assault_speed;;;;;Speed bonus applied to a unit during heroic assault. A value of 0.4 would mean a 40% speed bonus.:::::special_ability_bonus_inspire_unit_marksmanship;;;;;stat bonus applied to unit\'s reload skill when inspired:::::special_ability_bonus_inspire_unit_melee_attack;;;;;stat bonus applied to unit\'s melee attack when inspired:::::special_ability_bonus_inspire_unit_morale;;;;;inspires unit:::::special_ability_bonus_inspire_unit_reload_rate;;;;;The bonus inspire gives to unit\'s relaod rate when inspired:::::special_ability_bonus_kill_zone_accuracy;;;;;Bonus to accuracy for the kill zone ability:::::special_ability_bonus_overcharge_engines_move_speed;;;;;The increase to add to the speed scalar:::::special_ability_bonus_rally_max;;;;;rally max:::::special_ability_bonus_rally_min;;;;;rally min:::::special_ability_bonus_rally_naval_non_routing;;;;;Score to bring the ship\'s morale up by [Naval]:::::special_ability_bonus_rally_naval_routing_threshold;;;;;for routing ships; the target morale to change to [Naval]:::::special_ability_bonus_rally_non_routing;;;;;Bonus to be given to non-routing units:::::special_ability_bonus_rally_routing_threshold;;;;;Routing units will be given a rally bonus to bring their morale score to this value:::::special_ability_bonus_ramming_speed_move_speed;;;;;Bonus to speed when ramming 3.0 means 300% increase speed.:::::special_ability_bonus_range_increase_max_range;;;;;When a unit\'s \'increase range\' ability is activated, their range stat is increased by this amount (hard value):::::special_ability_bonus_rapid_advance_charge_attack;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_bonus_rapid_advance_speed;;;;;SPECIAL CASE (scalar) : the amount added to the modifier for speed:::::special_ability_bonus_rapid_volley_reload_rate;;;;;boost is applied to the unit\'s core loading skill:::::special_ability_bonus_second_wind_fatigue_reduction;;;;;the amount of fatigue reduction per entity when this ability is activated:::::special_ability_bonus_speed_increase;;;;;SPECIAL CASE (scalar): whenever a unit has an ability to increase their speed, this factor is applied:::::special_ability_bonus_stand_firm_melee_defence;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_bonus_suppression_fire_reload;;;;;Bonus to reloading for suppression fire:::::special_ability_bonus_tower_faster_firing_reload_rate;;;;;Scalar bonus to the reload rate of the tower:::::special_ability_bonus_tower_faster_reload_rate;;;;;Scalar bonus to the reload rate of the tower:::::special_ability_bonus_tower_rapid_volley_reload_rate;;;;;The amount to change the reload scalar rate by:::::special_ability_bonus_we_stand_and_fight_melee_attack;;;;;Bonus to melee attack when under the effect of We Stand And Fight! special ability:::::special_ability_bonus_we_stand_and_fight_reload_rate;;;;;Bonus to reloading rate when under the effect of We Stand And Fight! special ability:::::special_ability_penalty_anti_rally;;;;;Penalty applied to enemy units when anti rally is used:::::special_ability_penalty_banzai_charge_attack;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_penalty_banzai_melee_attack;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_penalty_banzai_move_speed;;;;;Speed debuff applied during Banzai\'s debuff period. Scalar. A value of -0.6 would mean a 60% penalty (so the unit moves at 40% speed).:::::special_ability_penalty_blinding_grenade_accuracy;;;;;penalty is applied to the unit\'s core marksmanship:::::special_ability_penalty_blinding_grenade_melee_attack;;;;;the amount of melee penalty the unit takes when hit by blinding grenades:::::special_ability_penalty_blinding_grenade_tracking_duration;;;;;the amount of time that an individual blinding grenade explosion tracks when it hit a unit (so it can total up the number of men hit over time):::::special_ability_penalty_faster_reload_reload_rate;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_penalty_overcharge_engines_move_speed;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_penalty_ramming_speed_turn_rate;;;;;Penalty to turn rate when ramming -0.8 means you are down to 20% normal turn rate.:::::special_ability_penalty_stand_firm_move_speed;;;;;Speed penalty applied to units under the effect of Stand Firm. Scalar. A value of -0.6 would mean a 60% penalty (so the unit moves at 40% speed).:::::special_ability_penalty_suppression_fire_accuracy;;;;;Penalty to accuracy for suppression fire:::::special_ability_penalty_suppression_fire_morale;;;;;Penalty to a unit\'s morale if hit by suppressive shots:::::special_ability_penalty_suppression_fire_move_speed;;;;;Speed penalty applied to units under the effect of Suppression. Scalar. A value of -0.6 would mean a 60% penalty (so the unit moves at 40% speed).:::::special_ability_penalty_tower_faster_firing_reload_rate;;;;;Scalar penalty to the reload rate of a tower:::::special_ability_penalty_warcry_melee_defence;;;;;The amount of defence a unit will lose when under a negative influence:::::special_ability_penalty_warcry_morale;;;;;The penalty amount the warcry effect has:::::special_ability_penalty_warcry_move_speed;;;;;The ratio of movement speed once affected by this ability. -0.2 would mean a 20% penalty (so 80% move speed).:::::special_ability_penalty_warcry_naval_melee_attack;;;;;Penalty to opposing crews\' melee attacks:::::special_ability_penalty_warcry_naval_melee_defence;;;;;Penalty to opposing crews\' melee defence:::::special_ability_penalty_whistling_arrows_melee_attack;;;;;Penalty is applied to the unit\'s base melee attack:::::special_ability_penalty_whistling_arrows_morale;;;;;Amount to take away from a unit\'s morale if hit by whistling arrows:::::special_ability_penalty_whistling_arrows_naval_melee_attack;;;;;Penalty to melee attack if attacked by whistlnig arrows [Naval]:::::special_ability_penalty_whistling_arrows_naval_morale;;;;;morale penalty for being hit by whistling arrows [Naval]:::::special_ability_penalty_whistling_arrows_naval_reload_rate;;;;;Penalty to reload rate if attacked by whistlnig arrows [Naval]:::::special_ability_penalty_whistling_arrows_reload_rate;;;;;Penatly is applied to the unit\'s core reload skill:::::special_ability_penalty_whistling_arrows_tracking_duration;;;;;The amount of time that a unit will be affected by whistling arrows\' detrimental effect:::::special_ability_unary_blinding_grenade_amount_for_full_effect;;;;;The percentage of men that needs to be hit in a unit (by blinding grenades) for the full effect of the ability:::::special_ability_unary_blinding_grenade_min_amount_for_effect;;;;;The minimum percentage of men that needs to be hit in a unit (by blinding grenades) for the ability to have any affect:::::special_ability_unary_faster_reload_detrimental_effect;;;;;TODO:::::special_ability_unary_overcharge_explode_chance;;;;;The chance a ship will explode after overcharging",
            },
        },
