        "campaign_variables_tables": {
            "variable_key": {
                "lookup_hardcoded": "agents_per_tech_cap;;;;;The maximum number of agents that can be assigned to research one technology.:::::annexed_territory_multiplier_on_realm_divide;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiplier applied to player annexed_territory diplomatic factor after realm divide has occured.:::::artillery_capture_chance;;;;;Chance of capturing an artillery unit from the losing side after a battle (percent 0-100):::::artillery_support_arrival_window_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Window, in seconds, during which all shells will arrive:::::artillery_support_arrival_window_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Window, in seconds, during which all shells will arrive (max):::::artillery_support_cooldown_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Artillery support cooldown between uses (seconds):::::artillery_support_cooldown_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum artillery support cooldown between uses (seconds):::::artillery_support_damage_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Artillery support damage per shell (DEFUNCT - projectile type-dependent):::::artillery_support_damage_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum rtillery support damage per shell (DEFUNCT - projectile type-dependent):::::artillery_support_impact_time_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Artillery support time for artillery shells to arrive (seconds):::::artillery_support_impact_time_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum artillery support time for artillery shells to arrive (seconds):::::artillery_support_radius_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Artillery support impact radius (metres):::::artillery_support_radius_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum artillery support impact radius (metres):::::artillery_support_shells_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Artillery support number of shells per use:::::artillery_support_shells_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum artillery support number of shells per use:::::artillery_support_uses_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Artillery support number of uses:::::artillery_support_uses_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum artillery support number of uses:::::autoresolve_advantage_over_enemy_wipeout_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The advantage an alliance must have over the enemy, to wipe out the opposition on a win in the autoresolver:::::autoresolve_alliance_additional_damage_chance;;;;;The chance of losing units receiving additional casualty by chase down:::::autoresolve_alliance_max_performance;;;;;Maximum variation for performance in an alliance. Units will have performance between (1 – alliance_max_performance) and (1 + alliance_max_performance):::::autoresolve_alliance_min_performance;;;;;Minimum variation for performance in an alliance.. Units will have performance between (1 – alliance_min_performance) and (1 + alliance_min_performance):::::autoresolve_alliance_performance_gaussian_range;;;;;The range of Gaussian random numbers for alliance performance:::::autoresolve_alliance_performance_gaussian_sd;;;;;The standard deviation to be used when calculating Gaussian random numbers for alliance performance:::::autoresolve_alliance_star_performance_modifier;;;;;The additional performance given to each unit per star level:::::autoresolve_alliance_wipe_out_win_percentage;;;;;A losing alliance will be wiped out when the win percentage is below this threshold:::::autoresolve_base_best_ship_kills_to_capture;;;;;(IN GAME) The base proportion of losing navy kills that should be converted to captures (may choose to not capture these depending on the random factor applied later):::::autoresolve_base_chance_a_unit_takes_captives;;;;;(IN GAME) This is a modifier applied to when calculating whether to take captives or not for a particular unit. Depending on the units base morale this is either added or deducted from the chance to take captives:::::autoresolve_base_ratio_of_captives;;;;;Base ratio of captives to take in the range 0.0 -> 1.0. This is then modified. Keep to a low number.:::::autoresolve_base_ratio_of_captives_modifier;;;;;This is a modifier that\'s randomised and then added or subtracted from the base ratio. So If you have a base ratio of 0.1 (10%) and a modifier of 0.75 (75%) you will have a base ratio between 0.025 and 0.175.:::::autoresolve_bos_art_missile_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) A modifier for artillery missile combat in the autoresolver. Does not effect the gatling gun in any way. Boshin only.:::::autoresolve_bos_artillery_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Damage multiplier for artillery support:::::autoresolve_bos_coastal_defence_damage_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Damage multiplier for coastal defences:::::autoresolve_bos_gatling_missile_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) A modifier for gatling gun missile combat in the autoresolver. Boshin only.:::::autoresolve_bos_land_missile_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) A multiplier for boshin land unit missile potential in the autoresolver:::::autoresolve_bos_land_missile_sett_def_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) A multiplier for boshin land unit missile potential in the autoresolver. This is applied to the defender units in a siege battle.:::::autoresolve_bos_naval_ranged_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of ranged turns each naval unit gets in boshin battles. Used for balancing ranged and boarding damage.:::::autoresolve_bos_unit_land_max_total_potential;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum total potential allowed for a land unit in Boshin. Total potential is melee + missile. Values above this max will be scaled down to fit within this bound.:::::autoresolve_bos_unit_naval_crew_missile_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiply the vs crew combat potential for naval units in boshin battles. Used for balancing crew and hull damage in ranged combat.:::::autoresolve_bos_unit_naval_hull_missile_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiply the vs hull combat potential for naval units in boshin battles. Used for balancing crew and hull damage in ranged combat.:::::autoresolve_bos_unit_naval_missile_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Multiply the total combat potential for naval units in boshin battles. Used for balancing ranged and boarding damage.:::::autoresolve_chance_of_not_capturing_ship;;;;;(IN GAME) The chance we will not take a ship from the set of possible ships to capture:::::autoresolve_chance_of_taking_captives;;;;;(IN GAME) Base chance ( 0.0 -> 1.0 ) of taking captives. Modified by generals, being out numbered etc...:::::autoresolve_commander_star_rating_impact;;;;;(IN GAME) The effect an advantage in the generals star rating has on the win chances, effects the overall win chance:::::autoresolve_easy_campaign_AI_percent_reduction;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount to increase AI casualties in autoresolved battles when campaign difficulty level is easy:::::autoresolve_easy_difficulty_human_advantage;;;;;(IN GAME) The advantage (applied to combat potential) human units recieve when the battle is austoresolved on battle difficulty easy:::::autoresolve_gaussian_boundary;;;;;(IN GAME) Represents a positive/negative range for Gaussian random numbers - number will never be out of this range:::::autoresolve_gaussian_standard_deviation;;;;;(IN GAME) The standard deviation to be used when calculating Gaussian random numbers:::::autoresolve_hard_campaign_AI_percent_increase;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount to decrease AI casulaties in autoresolved battles when campaign difficulty level is hard:::::autoresolve_hard_difficulty_AI_advantage;;;;;(IN GAME) The advantage (applied to combat potential) AI units recieve when the battle is autoresolved on battle difficulty hard:::::autoresolve_major_land_victory_percent;;;;;(IN GAME) The casualty percentage improvement/impedance (winner/loser respectively) on a major victory:::::autoresolve_major_naval_victory_lose_percent;;;;;(IN GAME) The casualty percentage impedance for naval loser on a major loss:::::autoresolve_major_naval_victory_win_percent;;;;;(IN GAME) The casualty percentage improvement for naval winner on a major victory:::::autoresolve_min_combat_potential_only_win_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) The percentage of the win chances that should always be calculated by the unit combat potential alone.:::::autoresolve_minimum_casualties_on_lose;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum casualties percentage for a unit on an alliances lose:::::autoresolve_minimum_casualties_on_win;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum casualties percentage for a unit on an alliances win (altered for class and relative strengths):::::autoresolve_minimum_win_chance_to_win;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum win chance of an alliance, if their win chance is less than this they cannot win the autoresolve battle.:::::autoresolve_minor_land_victory_percent;;;;;(IN GAME) The casualty percentage improvement/impedance (loser/winner respectively) on a minor victory:::::autoresolve_minor_naval_victory_lose_percent;;;;;(IN GAME) The casualty percentage impedance for naval loser on a minor loss:::::autoresolve_minor_naval_victory_win_percent;;;;;(IN GAME) The casualty percentage improvement for naval winner on a minor victory:::::autoresolve_naval_capture_roll;;;;;Chance to capture a ship:::::autoresolve_naval_chasing_speed_multiplier;;;;;When chasing down ships for capture. This is the chasing ships speed modification.:::::autoresolve_normal_naval_victory_lose_percent;;;;;(IN GAME) The casualty percentage impedance for naval loser on a normal loss:::::autoresolve_normal_naval_victory_win_percent;;;;;(IN GAME) The casualty percentage improvement for naval winner on a normal victory:::::autoresolve_relative_captives_fuzziness;;;;;(IN GAME) The randomness to apply to the amount of captives % of base captives - keep it low:::::autoresolve_ship_damage_capture_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) The percentage of damage to keep on a ship that has been reassigned from sunk to captured:::::autoresolve_ship_damage_fuzziness;;;;;(IN GAME) Randomness of each ships damage, to represent vageries of battle - keep it low:::::autoresolve_ship_damage_required_for_sink;;;;;(IN GAME) The percent damage required for a ship unit to sink:::::autoresolve_stat_massacre_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) Chance of massacre, compared to a normal win:::::autoresolve_unit_ambush_combat_multiplier;;;;;Combat potential multiplier for units with an ambush bonus:::::autoresolve_unit_land_base_rout_point;;;;;Units will have a maximum rout strength of this value:::::autoresolve_unit_land_hero_melee_multiplier;;;;;Melee combat potential multiplier for hero units:::::autoresolve_unit_land_hero_missile_multiplier;;;;;Missile combat potential multiplier for hero units:::::autoresolve_unit_land_max_ranged_turns;;;;;The maximum number of ranged hits a unit can perform:::::autoresolve_unit_land_missile_multiplier;;;;;Missile damage modifier for ranged combat:::::autoresolve_unit_land_ranged_casualty_reduction;;;;;The maximum causality reduction for winning ranged unit at maximum win chance:::::autoresolve_unit_land_ranged_turns_multiplier;;;;;Modify the number of ranged hits a unit performs:::::autoresolve_unit_losses_fuzziness;;;;;(IN GAME) Randomness of each units losses, to represent vageries of battle - keep it low:::::autoresolve_unit_naval_crew_missile_multiplier;;;;;Missile crew damage modifier in ranged combat:::::autoresolve_unit_naval_hull_missile_multiplier;;;;;Missile hull damage modifier in ranged combat:::::autoresolve_unit_naval_missile_multiplier;;;;;Missile damage modifier for ranged combat:::::autoresolve_unit_naval_surrender_threshold;;;;;Ships will surrender when their crew reach this strength percentage:::::autoresolve_unit_performance_gaussian_range;;;;;The range of Gaussian random numbers for alliance performance:::::autoresolve_unit_performance_gaussian_sd;;;;;The standard deviation to be used when calculating Gaussian random numbers for unit performance:::::autoresolve_unit_protect_faction_leader;;;;;Faction leader will have this casualty modifier after battle:::::autoresolve_unit_protect_lose;;;;;Protected units will have this casualty modifier on lose:::::autoresolve_unit_protect_major_win;;;;;Protected units will have this casualty modifier on major win:::::autoresolve_unit_protect_win;;;;;Protected units will have this casualty modifier on win:::::autoresolve_unit_wipe_out_threshold;;;;;Units will be wiped out if their percentage strength is below this threshold:::::autoresolve_unlikely_naval_result_scaling_factor;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount the damage probability should be scaled by the win chance in a naval battle with an unlikely result:::::autoresolve_very_hard_campaign_AI_percent_increase;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount to decrease AI casulaties in autoresolved battles when campaign difficulty level is very hard:::::autoresolve_very_hard_difficulty_AI_advantage;;;;;(IN GAME) The advantage (applied to combat potential) AI units recieve when the battle is austoresolved on battle difficulty very hard:::::background_resource_supply;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of resource units always available on the global market for each resource (to prevent division by zero).:::::base_wealth_increase;;;;;(IN GAME) The base amount of TW required for a town to grow its wealth level. Formula: base_wealth_increase*power((total_wealth_increases+1),2):::::baseline_pop_growth;;;;;(IN GAME) Pop growth percentage in every region regardless of farms. We might want to define this on a per-region basis?:::::bombardment_campaign_base_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) The base chance of hitting for bombardment by a naval unit on the campaign map.:::::bombardment_campaign_base_damage;;;;;(IN GAME) The base damage figure for bombardment by a naval unit on the campaign map.:::::bombardment_campaign_chance_per_ability_point;;;;;(IN GAME) The increase in hit chance for each point in bombard ability for bombardment by a naval unit on the campaign map.:::::bombardment_campaign_chance_per_experience_level;;;;;(IN GAME) The increase in hit chance for each experience level for bombardment by a naval unit on the campaign map.:::::bombardment_campaign_damage_per_ability_point;;;;;(IN GAME) The increase in damage for each point in bombard ability for bombardment by a naval unit on the campaign map.:::::bombardment_campaign_damage_per_experience_level;;;;;(IN GAME) The increase in damage for each experience level for bombardment by a naval unit on the campaign map.:::::bombardment_experience_gain;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of experience granted to a ship for a successful bombardment action.:::::bombardment_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Base distance at which targets can be bombarded.:::::cai_cnstr_priority_over_cost_modification;;;;;(IN GAME) When considering the importance of buildings for a specific context how much should value for money count versus raw priority (0.0, not a bit to 1.0, entirely):::::cai_finance_const_bias_easy_level;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias, easy difficulty, levels to apply at:::::cai_finance_const_bias_easy_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias,easy difficulty, rounds to apply for:::::cai_finance_const_bias_hard_level;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias, hard difficulty, levels to apply at:::::cai_finance_const_bias_hard_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias, hard difficulty, rounds to apply for:::::cai_finance_const_bias_legendary_level;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias, legendary difficulty, levels to apply at:::::cai_finance_const_bias_legendary_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias, legendary difficulty, rounds to apply for:::::cai_finance_const_bias_normal_level;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias, normal difficulty, levels to apply at:::::cai_finance_const_bias_normal_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias, normal difficulty, rounds to apply for:::::cai_finance_const_bias_very_hard_level;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias, very hard difficulty, levels to apply at:::::cai_finance_const_bias_very_hard_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) CAI Budgeting bias, very hard difficulty, rounds to apply for:::::cai_food_ctrl_building_apply_bonus_at_or_below;;;;;(IN GAME) The point at or below which bonus will be provided to food producgin buildings:::::cai_food_ctrl_building_apply_penalty_below;;;;;(IN GAME) The point below which a food penalty will be applied to a building option:::::cai_food_ctrl_building_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) Bonus applied (per food point) for buildings that increae food up to the specified level:::::cai_food_ctrl_building_penalty;;;;;(IN GAME) Penalty applied (per food point) for buildings that use food beyond the specified level:::::cai_rfb_easy_no_below_min_units;;;;;(IN GAME) Below this number of defending units don\'t allow retreat (easy difficulty):::::cai_rfb_easy_yes_below_ratio_no_sett_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) If defender can not retreat to a settlement and defender/attacker strength ratio is below this number, retreat (easy difficulty):::::cai_rfb_easy_yes_below_ratio_sett_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) If defender can retreat to a settlement and defender/attacker strength ratio is below this number, retreat (easy difficulty):::::cai_rfb_hard_no_below_min_units;;;;;(IN GAME) Below this number of defending units don\'t allow retreat (hard difficulty):::::cai_rfb_hard_yes_below_ratio_no_sett_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) If defender can not retreat to a settlement and defender/attacker strength ratio is below this number, retreat (hardl difficulty):::::cai_rfb_hard_yes_below_ratio_sett_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) If defender can retreat to a settlement and defender/attacker strength ratio is below this number, retreat (hard difficulty):::::cai_rfb_normal_no_below_min_units;;;;;(IN GAME) Below this number of defending units don\'t allow retreat (normal difficulty):::::cai_rfb_normal_yes_below_ratio_no_sett_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) If defender can not retreat to a settlement and defender/attacker strength ratio is below this number, retreat (normal difficulty):::::cai_rfb_normal_yes_below_ratio_sett_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) If defender can retreat to a settlement and defender/attacker strength ratio is below this number, retreat (normal difficulty):::::cai_rfb_test_versus_ai;;;;;(IN GAME) Above zero, allows AI to consider retreat versus another AI:::::cai_rfb_vhard_no_below_min_units;;;;;(IN GAME) Below this number of defending units don\'t allow retreat (very hard difficulty):::::cai_rfb_vhard_yes_below_ratio_no_sett_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) If defender can not retreat to a settlement and defender/attacker strength ratio is below this number, retreat (very hard difficulty):::::cai_rfb_vhard_yes_below_ratio_sett_retreat;;;;;(IN GAME) If defender can retreat to a settlement and defender/attacker strength ratio is below this number, retreat (very hard difficulty):::::captured_required_region_prestige_multiplier;;;;;(Not in use) Integer only.The multiplier applied to a regions prestige if that region is a region the capturing faction must capture to fulfill its victory conditions:::::cdir_unit_quality_accuracy_value;;;;;The quality value boost for a unit with accuracy upgrades.:::::cdir_unit_quality_armour_value;;;;;The quality value boost for a unit with armour upgrades.:::::cdir_unit_quality_charge_value;;;;;The quality value boost for a unit with charge upgrades.:::::cdir_unit_quality_experience_value;;;;;The quality value boost for 1 unit of experience.:::::cdir_unit_quality_morale_value;;;;;The quality value boost for a unit with morale upgrades.:::::cdir_unit_quality_weapons_value;;;;;The quality value boost for a unit with weapons upgrades.:::::character_recruitment_base_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) Base recruitment cost for characters:::::character_recruitment_cost_per_command_star;;;;;(IN GAME) Cost each command star adds to the cost of the character.:::::character_recruitment_max_distance;;;;;(IN GAME) Max distance for character recruitment  (recruitment over this distance will result in a capped distance-cost modifier):::::character_recruitment_pool_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum size of the character recruitment pool:::::character_recruitment_pool_refill_rate_admiral_0;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns it takes to add a new admiral to the character recruitment pool.:::::character_recruitment_pool_refill_rate_admiral_1;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns it takes to add a new admiral to the character recruitment pool. Activated by bonus value.:::::character_recruitment_pool_refill_rate_admiral_2;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns it takes to add a new admiral to the character recruitment pool. Activated by bonus value.:::::character_recruitment_pool_refill_rate_general_0;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns it takes to add a new general to the character recruitment pool.:::::character_recruitment_pool_refill_rate_general_1;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns it takes to add a new admiral to the character recruitment pool. Activated by bonus value.:::::character_recruitment_pool_refill_rate_general_2;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of turns it takes to add a new admiral to the character recruitment pool. Activated by bonus value.:::::character_research_points_cap;;;;;(IN GAME)  Research points being contributed by character attributes are clamped to this value in any research slot:::::daimyo_honour_effect_acquired_vassal_clan;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted for acquiring a vassal clan.:::::daimyo_honour_effect_assassination_attempt;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted for detected assassination attempts.:::::daimyo_honour_effect_becoming_christian;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted by becoming christian.:::::daimyo_honour_effect_being_christian;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted by being christian.:::::daimyo_honour_effect_crushing_defeat;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted by a crushing defeat in which the daimyo is involved.:::::daimyo_honour_effect_dishonouring_alliance;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted for dishonouring alliances.:::::daimyo_honour_effect_eradicated_clan;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted by an army containing the daimyo capturing a faction\'s last region.:::::daimyo_honour_effect_heroic_victory;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted by a heroic victory in which the daimyo is involved.:::::daimyo_honour_effect_looting_city;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted for looting a city.:::::daimyo_honour_effect_threatening_with_empty_words;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount of daimyo honour granted for following through on a rejected diplomatic threat.:::::display_ambient_village_level_0_round_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The threshold round number for villages to start appearing:::::display_ambient_village_level_1_round_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The threshold round number for level 1 villages:::::display_ambient_village_level_2_round_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The threshold round number for level 2 villages:::::display_ambient_village_level_3_round_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The threshold round number for level 3 villages:::::display_ambient_village_update_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) The chance of a village to change model, per round, after a new threshold has been reached:::::display_bombard_angle_offset;;;;;(IN GAME) The inital angle of bombardment cannons  (campaign map display):::::display_bombard_cannon_fire_offset;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum time between bombard cannons firing  (campaign map display):::::display_bombard_character_impact_height;;;;;(IN GAME) The height above terrain that a bombard impact will hit a character  (campaign map display):::::display_bombard_garrison_impact_height;;;;;(IN GAME) The height above terrain that a bombard impact will hit a garrison  (campaign map display):::::display_bombard_projectile_speed;;;;;(IN GAME) Bombardment cannonball speed  (campaign map display):::::display_bombard_target_offset;;;;;(IN GAME) The distance between cannonballs on bombard impact   (campaign map display):::::display_coastal_def_cannon_chance_to_hit;;;;;(IN GAME) Chance for a coastal defence cannon to cause an impact effect on the target ship (campaign map display):::::display_coastal_def_cannon_chance_to_splash;;;;;(IN GAME) Chance for a coastal defence cannon to cause a splash around the target ship (campaign map display):::::display_coastal_def_cannon_reload_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time it takes for coastal defence cannons to reload (campaign map display):::::display_coastal_def_max_building_fire_offset;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum time in seconds between coastal defence building becoming active (campaign map display):::::display_coastal_def_max_cannon_fire_offset;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum time in seconds a cannon can fire after it\'s defence building has become active (campaign map display):::::display_coastal_def_splash_delay_after_cannon;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in seconds between a cannon firing and a splash effect firing (campaign map display):::::display_coastal_def_splash_max_distance_from_ship;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum distance from the centre of the target ship that a splash effect can fire (campaign map display):::::display_coastal_def_splash_min_distance_from_ship;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum distance from the centre of the target ship that a splash effect can fire (campaign map display):::::display_trade_route_fade_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of milliseconds to fade trade routes over.:::::display_trade_route_maximum_flow_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) The scale of trade carts/ships for a trade route of maximum flow.:::::display_trade_route_maximum_flow_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in milliseconds between trade carts/ships for a trade route of maximum flow.:::::display_trade_route_maximum_flow_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The upper value limit for trade route display.  Trade routes with values greater than this are displayed as if they had this value.:::::display_trade_route_minimum_flow_scale;;;;;(IN GAME) The scale of trade carts/ships for a trade route of minimum flow.:::::display_trade_route_minimum_flow_time;;;;;(IN GAME) The time in milliseconds between trade carts/ships for a trade route of minimum flow.:::::display_trade_route_minimum_flow_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The lower value limit for trade route display.  Trade routes with values less than this are displayed as if they had this value.:::::display_trade_route_sea_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) The relative time taken for a trade ship to travel the same distance as a trade cart.:::::display_trade_route_trader_offset;;;;;(IN GAME) The distance offset of the trader to the left of the route in units.:::::display_trade_route_trader_speed;;;;;(IN GAME) The speed of trade carts in units/second.:::::faction_gdp_other;;;;;(IN GAME) Background gdp value.:::::faction_gdp_other_minor;;;;;(IN GAME) Background gdp value for minor nations.:::::faction_leader_management_level_0_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_level_1_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_level_2_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_level_3_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_level_4_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_level_5_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_level_6_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_level_7_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_level_8_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_level_9_to_value;;;;;Integer only. This maps the faction leaders management attribute to a value ( such as +1 / -1 etc... ). This is applied to the ministers management level for working out the minister effects.:::::faction_leader_management_value_mod_abs_monarchy;;;;;This is multiplied to the value for the faction_leader_management_level for an absolute monarchy government type.:::::faction_leader_management_value_mod_cons_monarchy;;;;;This is multiplied to the value for the faction_leader_management_level for a constitutional monarchy government type.:::::faction_leader_management_value_mod_republic;;;;;This is multiplied to the value for the faction_leader_management_level for a republic government type.:::::family_age_of_adulthood;;;;;(IN GAME) The age at which family members can first be considered adults.:::::family_age_of_guaranteed_adulthood;;;;;(IN GAME) The age at which family members will definitely be considered adults.:::::family_base_child_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) The base chance of family members having a child.:::::family_base_wife_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) The base percentage chance of a male child being offered a wife from one of the clans retainer families.:::::family_chance_of_adulthood;;;;;(IN GAME) The chance each turn that a child of appropriate age will be considered adult.:::::family_emergent_daimyo_maximum_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum age of a daimyo created on faction emergence.:::::family_emergent_daimyo_minimum_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum age of a daimyo created on faction emergence.:::::family_emergent_wife_maximum_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum age of a daimyo\'s wife created on faction emergence.:::::family_husband_decreasing_child_chance_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The age at which the fathers chance of having children starts to decrease.:::::family_male_child_chance;;;;;(IN GAME) The percentage chance of any child being male.:::::family_maximum_child_chance_decrease_due_to_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum decrease in chance of family members having a child due to the husbands age.:::::family_maximum_number_of_children;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum number of children per family unit.:::::family_minimum_hostage_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum age for a family member to become a hostage.:::::family_retainer_daimyo_maximum_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum age for a retainer daimyo on creation.:::::family_retainer_daimyo_minimum_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum age for a retainer daimyos on creation.:::::family_retainer_wife_maximum_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum_age for wifes offered to male children from one of the clans retainer families.:::::family_rounds_between_bereavement_and_remarriage;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of rounds between a character dieing and their surviving spouse being eligable to remarry.:::::family_rounds_between_children;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of rounds that must pass after a child is born before the parents may have another child.:::::family_rounds_between_marriage_and_first_child;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of rounds that must pass after family members marry before they can have a child.:::::family_rounds_between_wife_offers;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of rounds that must pass after a male child refuses an offer of a wife from one of the clans retainer families before he may be offered another one.:::::family_turns_before_any_chance_of_adulthood;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of turns at start of game before any non-adult family member can be considered adult.:::::family_wife_barren_age;;;;;(IN GAME) The age at which women cease to have children.:::::family_wife_chance_increase_period;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of years between each increase of the chance of a male child being offered a wife from one of the clans retainer families.:::::family_wife_chance_increase_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The percentage by which the chance of a male child being offered a wife from one of the clans retainer families increases over time.:::::food_surplus_town_wealth_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) The global food surplus multiplied by this value is applied as a town wealth growth factor to all regions.:::::gempei_cai_aggr_ramp_chance_base;;;;;(IN GAME) Base chance per round that an eligible faction will be selected for aggression increase. Base Chance + (Rounds Played * Per Round Chance):::::gempei_cai_aggr_ramp_chance_per_round;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional per round chance that an eligible faction will be selected for aggression increase. Base Chance + (Rounds Played * Per Round Chance):::::gempei_cai_aggr_ramp_enabled;;;;;(IN GAME) Whether the aggression ramp is enable. 0=no, 1=yes:::::gempei_cai_aggr_ramp_fame_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Player fame level at which the ramp ends and the maximum level of aggression will be applied.:::::gempei_cai_aggr_ramp_fame_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Player fame level beyond which the aggression ramp will start to apply:::::gempei_cai_aggr_ramp_level_max;;;;;(IN GAME) The ending level for the aggression ramp to use. 1-6. Should be equal to or greater than the minimum level selected. 1=LOW, 2=LOW_TO_MEDIUM, 3=MEDIUM, 4=MEDIUM_TO_HIGH, 5=HIGH, 6=VERY HIGH.:::::gempei_cai_aggr_ramp_level_min;;;;;(IN GAME) The starting level for the aggression ramp to use. 1-6. 1=LOW, 2=LOW_TO_MEDIUM, 3=MEDIUM, 4=MEDIUM_TO_HIGH, 5=HIGH, 6=VERY HIGH.:::::gempei_cai_aggr_ramp_rounds_max;;;;;(IN GAME) Round at which the ramp should finish (and max level be used for aggression increases):::::gempei_cai_aggr_ramp_rounds_min;;;;;(IN GAME) Round beyond which the aggression ramp will start (beginning with the minimum aggression level):::::gempei_cai_consider_major_over_regions;;;;;(IN GAME) In Gempei targetting and diplomatic adjustments the number of regions a minor faction must own before being considered major.:::::gempei_cai_fnca_aid_minor_ally_padj;;;;;(IN GAME) In Gempei diplomatic adjustments the adjustment applied against the desire of a major clan to aid a minor clan ally when being attacked or attacking:::::gempei_cai_fnca_ally_minor_padj;;;;;(IN GAME) In Gempei diplomatic adjustments the adjustment applied against the desire of a major clan allying with a minor clan:::::gempei_cai_fnca_join_minor_ally_wadj;;;;;(IN GAME) In Gempei diplomatic adjustments the weighing multiplier applied for a major clan joining a war against a minor clan at the request of a minor clan:::::gempei_prestige_region_value_domination_easy;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Domination easy difficulty gempei campaign):::::gempei_prestige_region_value_domination_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Domination hard/very hard/legendary difficulty gempei campaign):::::gempei_prestige_region_value_domination_normal;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Domination normal difficulty gempei campaign):::::gempei_prestige_region_value_easy;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Long or MP easy difficulty gempei campaign):::::gempei_prestige_region_value_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Long or MP hard difficulty gempei campaign):::::gempei_prestige_region_value_normal;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Long or MP normal difficulty gempei campaign):::::gempei_prestige_region_value_short_easy;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Short easy difficulty gempei campaign):::::gempei_prestige_region_value_short_hard;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Short hard/very hard/legendary difficulty gempei campaign):::::gempei_prestige_region_value_short_normal;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Short normal difficulty gempei campaign):::::general_admiral_action_point_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) The base general/admiral action point bonus:::::general_promotion_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) Cost of a promoted general:::::gentleman_happiness_divisor;;;;;(IN GAME) Gentleman happiness effect in settlement is derived from attribute_level divided by this value (rounded up):::::gentleman_happiness_negative_limit;;;;;(IN GAME)  Total negative effect from all non-allied gentlemen in a settlement is clamped to this.:::::gentleman_happiness_positive_limit;;;;;(IN GAME)  Total positive effect from all allied gentlemen in a settlement is clamped to this.:::::happiness_revolution_culture;;;;;?:::::happiness_revolution_neighbour;;;;;Happiness effect of revolution in a neighbouring faction (per faction).:::::happiness_war_drift;;;;;Happiness effect of revolution of any faction in the same culture (per faction).:::::happiness_war_lower_cap;;;;;Upper (positive) happiness cap for war-related effects.:::::happiness_war_major_defeat;;;;;Lower (negative) unhappiness cap for war-related effects.:::::happiness_war_major_victory;;;;;Per-turn drift towards 0 of war-related happiness effects.:::::happiness_war_region_conquered;;;;;Happiness effect of a major defeat.:::::happiness_war_region_lost;;;;;Happiness effect of a major victory.:::::happiness_war_upper_cap;;;;;Happiness effect of taking a region from the enemy.:::::hostage_turns;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of turns a hostage is held for.:::::ikko_ikki_incite_revolt_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional cost for inciting revolt for Ikko Ikki monks:::::immigration_capacity;;;;;(IN GAME) As percentage of population:::::losing_unit_minimum_strength;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum pct of the losing units max soldiers a unit can have before it is destroyed:::::loyalty_1_chance_of_defection;;;;;(IN GAME) Chance of defection for a general with a loyalty of 1:::::loyalty_2_chance_of_defection;;;;;(IN GAME) Chance of defection for a general with a loyalty of 2:::::loyalty_adjustment_general_married_daughter;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount by which a generals loyalty increases when he is married to a family member.:::::loyalty_adjustment_lost_office_after_gaining_it;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount by which the loyalty of a general increases when they lose an office shortly after being granted it.:::::loyalty_adjustment_lower_level_granted_office;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount by which the loyalty of a general without an office increases when a lower level general is granted an office.:::::loyalty_adjustment_son_became_heir;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount by which a family members loyalty increases when they become the heir.:::::loyalty_adjustment_son_replaced_as_heir;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount by which a family members loyalty increases when they are replaced as the heir.:::::maximum_attrition_pct;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum percentage of a unit that is lost to attrition every turn:::::maximum_bombardment_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum distance at which targets can be bombarded.:::::maximum_daimyo_honour;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum possible amount of daimyo honour.:::::maximum_loyalty;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum possible amount of general loyalty.:::::maximum_port_bombardment_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum port bombardment radius:::::maximum_town_wealth_level;;;;;Levels of town wealth that exist in the game data.:::::migration_religion;;;;;0.0005 (IN GAME) Means X% of the minority will emigate:::::migration_unhappiness;;;;;0.012 (IN GAME) Percentage of net unhappiness contributing to unhappiness related migration. NUP% * X% * pop = emigration.:::::minimum_daimyo_honour;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum possible amount of daimyo honour.:::::minimum_loyalty;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum possible amount of general loyalty.:::::minimum_population;;;;;Minimum popluation for a region.:::::minimum_population_after_recruitment;;;;;(IN GAME) Mimimum population that must be left after recruitment;  so population must be at least this PLUS the recruitment population cost to enable recruitment.:::::mission_result_critical_failure_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Modification to critical failure chance:::::mission_result_critical_success_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) Modification to critical success chance:::::mp_armour_cost_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) The multiplier applied to the multiplayer cost of a unit when given an armour upgrade in multiplayer.:::::mp_armour_fixed_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) The fixed cost added to a unit when given an armour upgrade in multiplayer.:::::mp_weapon_cost_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) The multiplier applied to the multiplayer cost of a unit when given a weapon upgrade in multiplayer.:::::mp_weapon_fixed_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) The fixed cost added to a unit when given a weapon upgrade in multiplayer.:::::naval_attrition_crew_max_damage;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum crew damage recieved through naval attrition:::::naval_attrition_crew_min_damage;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum crew damage recieved through naval attrition:::::naval_attrition_crew_min_pct;;;;;(IN GAME) Crew damage threshold, below at which ships are counted as sunk:::::naval_attrition_hull_max_damage;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum hull damage recieved through naval attrition:::::naval_attrition_hull_min_damage;;;;;(IN GAME) Minimum hull damage recieved through naval attrition:::::naval_attrition_hull_min_pct;;;;;(IN GAME) Hull damage threshold, above which ships are counted as sunk:::::ninja_action_point_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) Pct per agent level action point bonus granted to armies:::::non_general_daimyo_starting_honour;;;;;(IN GAME) The initial honour for a non-general daimyo.:::::passive_spying_region_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) Passive spying calculation region bonus:::::policing_automated_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Maximum effect of happiness due to automated policing.:::::policing_automated_cost_per_pop;;;;;(IN GAME) Policing_pips (sum of both classes) * sqrt(population) * policing_automated_cost_per_pop:::::policing_garrison_cap;;;;;(IN GAME) Cap on happiness from garrisoned units.:::::pop_growth_for_spawn;;;;;(IN GAME) The percentage of population growth required to spawn a new town, relative to the population of the last spawning.:::::prestige_famous_battle_defeat_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted for losing a famous battle.:::::prestige_famous_battle_victory_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted for winning a famous battle.:::::prestige_level_emperor_acknowledgement;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points required for the emperor to acknowledge you.:::::prestige_level_public_knowledge;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points required for your faction to be known throughout japan.:::::prestige_level_realm_divide;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points required to trigger realm divide.:::::prestige_level_shogun_threat;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points required for you to be considered a threat to the shogunate.:::::prestige_limit_daimyo_honour;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum number of prestige points that can be gained from daimyo honour.:::::prestige_limit_famous_battles;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum number of prestige points that can be gained from famous battles.:::::prestige_limit_infrastructure;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum number of prestige points that can be gained from infrastructure.:::::prestige_protectorate_region_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region your protectorates own.:::::prestige_region_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Long campaign):::::prestige_region_value_domination;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Domination campaign):::::prestige_region_value_short;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of prestige points granted per region you own. (Short campaign):::::railway_num_carriages;;;;;(IN GAME)  The number of carriages per train for Boshin railways:::::railway_telegraph_pole_height;;;;;(IN GAME)  The height of telegraph poles for Boshin railways:::::railway_telegraph_pole_offset;;;;;(IN GAME)  The distance between telegraph poles for Boshin railways:::::railway_train_acceleration;;;;;(IN GAME)  The acceleration of the train for Boshin railways:::::railway_train_deceleration;;;;;(IN GAME)  The deceleration of the train for Boshin railways. Must be negative.:::::railway_train_height;;;;;(IN GAME)  The height of the train for Boshin railways:::::railway_train_max_speed;;;;;(IN GAME)  The maximum speed of the train for Boshin railways:::::railway_train_time_stopped_in_station;;;;;(IN GAME)  The length of time a train will be stationary in it\'s destination station:::::recruitment_population_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) Number by which population is reduced for recruitment of a single unit:::::reinforcement_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum distance from the edge of a zone of control a piece can be to reinforce.  Clamped between 0.1 and 4.0:::::road_level_0_action_point_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) The action point cost to travel 1 unit distance on level zero (unupgraded) roads.:::::road_level_1_action_point_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) The action point cost to travel 1 unit distance on level one roads.:::::road_level_2_action_point_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) The action point cost to travel 1 unit distance on level two roads.:::::road_level_3_action_point_cost;;;;;(IN GAME) The action point cost to travel 1 unit distance on level three roads.:::::rounds_between_taking_kyoto_and_becoming_shogun;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of rounds you must hold kyoto for before being declared shogun.:::::rounds_to_hold_office_before_loss_hits_loyalty;;;;;(IN GAME) The number of rounds between a general being granted an office and it being taken away without it affecting his loyalty.:::::settlement_looting_base_loot;;;;;(IN GAME) Base amount loot the looting force get when looting a settlement:::::settlement_looting_pct_region_gdp;;;;;(IN GAME) The pct of region town wealth given to a player when looting a settlement (0.0 - 1.0). Player also gets 0.15 of this % of GDP:::::settlement_looting_pct_region_gdp_reduction;;;;;(IN GAME) Percentage of region town wealth wiped out after looting. 0.0-1.0. (e.g. 0.7 means region town wealth reduced by 70%.):::::settlement_looting_publicorder_reduction;;;;;(IN GAME) Public order penalty when a settlement is looted.:::::settlement_looting_region_gdp_reduction_turns;;;;;(UNUSED). Number of turns the GDP reduction effect lasts for after looting a region:::::settlement_looting_surrender_publicorder_reduction;;;;;(IN GAME). Public order penalty when a settlement is looted after it has surrendered.:::::state_gift_multiplier_linear;;;;;(IN GAME) State gift diplomatic effect = (gift_value * state_gift_multiplier_linear) + (gift_value * gift_value * state_gift_multiplier_quadratic / root(combined_gdp)):::::state_gift_multiplier_quadratic;;;;;(IN GAME) State gift diplomatic effect = (gift_value * state_gift_multiplier_linear) + (gift_value * gift_value * state_gift_multiplier_quadratic / root(combined_gdp)):::::state_religion_conversion_bonus;;;;;Bonus for state religion conversion:::::tax_efficiency_log_base;;;;;(IN GAME) The logarithm base for the formula used for calculating loss of tax income from having too many regions.:::::tax_efficiency_modifier;;;;;(IN GAME) A multiplier on the loss of tax income from having too many regions.:::::tax_efficiency_region_modifier;;;;;(DEPRECATED) The percentage reduction in tax for each region in a governorship beyond the tax_efficiency_regions_minimum.:::::tax_efficiency_regions_minimum;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum number of regions before tax efficiency penalties apply.:::::tax_efficiency_total_regions;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum number of regions for tax efficiency purposes.:::::tech_first_in_culture_prestige_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME). Integer only. The multipler applied to a technology\'s prestige if the discovering in faction is the first faction in its culture to discover that technology:::::threat_effect_maximum;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum diplomatic comparison multiplier addition for deals involving threats.:::::threat_effect_minimum;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum diplomatic comparison multiplier addition for deals involving threats.:::::threat_effect_no_threat_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) The diplomatic comparison multiplier for deals not involving threats.:::::threat_reputation_maximum;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum threat reputation.:::::threat_reputation_minimum;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum threat reputation.:::::threat_reputation_reduction;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount by which the threat reputation is reduced every time an empty threat is made.:::::threat_reputation_rounds_before_required_war;;;;;(IN GAME) Number of rounds you have to declare war after a rejected diplomatic threat before everyone considers your threat empty.:::::threaten_modifier_ally_fame_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) The amount the average ally fame contributes to a coalition fame score.:::::threaten_modifier_base;;;;;(IN GAME) The base value for the threaten modifier.:::::threaten_modifier_fame_contribution_base;;;;;(IN GAME) The base fame value for the threaten modifier.:::::threaten_modifier_maximum;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum threaten modifier.:::::threaten_modifier_minimum;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum threaten modifier.:::::town_wealth_growth_discontent_reduction;;;;;(IN GAME). The amount town wealth is reduced when strikes, riots, ultimatums, letters of demand or rebellions are active in a region.:::::trade_commerce_raiding_maximum_raiding_permille;;;;;(IN GAME) The maximum proportion of a trade route which may be commerce raided, in thousandths.:::::trade_commerce_raiding_reduction_per_ship;;;;;(IN GAME) The proportion of this ships commerce raid value that the next commerce raiding ship downstream on this route will achieve.:::::trade_demand_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) The constant factor by which a factions gdp is multiplied to produce the faction trade resource consumption.:::::trade_luxury_resource_strategic_value;;;;;(IN GAME) The strategic value in trade for luxury resources or any resource which is already available to a faction.:::::trade_price_large_change_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum absolute difference between the current and target prices of a trade resource for the price change to be considered large.:::::trade_price_small_change_threshold;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum absolute difference between the current and target prices of a trade resource for the price change to be considered small.:::::trade_resource_region_gdp_contribution;;;;;(IN GAME) The proportion of trade resource value each resource not traded on to other factions contributes to total income:::::trade_route_internat_sea_length_limit;;;;;(IN GAME) Length limit on an international trade route.:::::trade_route_land_sea_bias;;;;;(IN GAME) How much land routes are preferred over sea routes (0.5 = sea routes twice as preferred).:::::trade_route_value_accumulator_proportion;;;;;(IN GAME) The proportion of the trade route value that gets accumulated each turn, \"time factor\".:::::trade_route_value_combined_gdp_proportion;;;;;(IN GAME) The proportion of the combined gdps of the two factions which contributes to the value of a trade route.:::::trade_ship_resource_volume;;;;;(UNUSED) Volume of resources a trade ship can export.:::::unilateral_diplomatic_gift_state_gift_proportion;;;;;(IN GAME) The proportion of the value of a state gift obtained for a unilateral diplomatic gift of equivalent raw value.:::::unit_first_in_culture_prestige_multiplier;;;;;(IN GAME) Integer only. The multipler applied to a unit\'s prestige if the recruiting in faction is the first faction in its culture to recruit a unit of that unit\'s class:::::unit_minimum_strength;;;;;(IN GAME) The minimum pct of the units max soldiers a unit can have before it is destroyed:::::unit_stat_accuracy_bonus_threshold_level_1;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'superior\' stat bonus:::::unit_stat_accuracy_bonus_threshold_level_2;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'exceptional\' stat bonus:::::unit_stat_armour_bonus_threshold_level_1;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'superior\' stat bonus:::::unit_stat_armour_bonus_threshold_level_2;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'exceptional\' stat bonus:::::unit_stat_charge_bonus_threshold_level_1;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'superior\' stat bonus:::::unit_stat_charge_bonus_threshold_level_2;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'exceptional\' stat bonus:::::unit_stat_melee_bonus_threshold_level_1;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'superior\' stat bonus:::::unit_stat_melee_bonus_threshold_level_2;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'exceptional\' stat bonus:::::unit_stat_morale_bonus_threshold_level_1;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'superior\' stat bonus:::::unit_stat_morale_bonus_threshold_level_2;;;;;(IN GAME) Threshold for \'exceptional\' stat bonus:::::zone_of_control_garrison_bonus;;;;;(IN GAME) Additional radius of the zone of control for pieces garrisoned in settlements or forts.  Clamped between 0.0 and 4.0:::::zone_of_control_land_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Radius of the zone of control for land pieces.  Clamped between 0.1 and 8.0:::::zone_of_control_naval_radius;;;;;(IN GAME) Radius of the zone of control for naval pieces.  Clamped between 0.1 and 15.0",
            },
        },
